{
    "title": "Police Radar - Camera Detector",
    "description": "Police Radar - Camera Detector (Anti Radar) - a reliable application with which you can see for free, stationary and mobile radar speed cameras on the roads and also mark them to warn road users.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f The application will help if you do not want to pay traffic fines and are afraid to lose your driver's license\r\n\r\nPolice Antiradar (radar detector) uses GPS coordinates of cameras and mobile police posts.\r\n\r\nFeatures of the application Police Scanner (Anti-Radar Detector):\r\n\r\n\u2713 Will help you avoid traffic fines for non-compliance with traffic rules\r\n\u2713 Free\r\n\u2713 Without registration\r\n\u2713 Shows stationary cameras on the road (anti-radar)\r\n\u2713 Shows mobile cameras and police patrols (if marked by other users)\r\n\u2713 Works as a GPS speedometer, displaying your speed\r\n\u2713 Shows speed limits on road sections near fixed speed cameras\r\n\r\nThe app also has: speedometer, HUD and projection display. With them you will know what your speed is. And see the speed limit signs.\r\n\r\nAnti-radar will replace your traditional radar detector, as it displays the location of portable cameras marked by other users of the application in addition to the official stationary cameras. Now you can not only flash your headlights and honk to each other on the roads, but also inform everyone about where the traffic cops are and where the cameras on the roads.\r\n\r\nGPS anti-radar detector will show where the traffic cops are online, cameras on the roads and will help you avoid trouble: speeding, police fines, communication with traffic police.\r\n\r\nWhat anti radar (radar detector) is better to install for free? Of course, Police Radar - Detector of traffic police cameras.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Police Radar - Camera Detector (Anti Radar) - a reliable application with which you can see for free, stationary and mobile radar speed cameras on the roads and also mark them to warn road users.<br><br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f The application will help if you do not want to pay traffic fines and are afraid to lose your driver&#39;s license<br><br>Police Antiradar (radar detector) uses GPS coordinates of cameras and mobile police posts.<br><br>Features of the application Police Scanner (Anti-Radar Detector):<br><br>\u2713 Will help you avoid traffic fines for non-compliance with traffic rules<br>\u2713 Free<br>\u2713 Without registration<br>\u2713 Shows stationary cameras on the road (anti-radar)<br>\u2713 Shows mobile cameras and police patrols (if marked by other users)<br>\u2713 Works as a GPS speedometer, displaying your speed<br>\u2713 Shows speed limits on road sections near fixed speed cameras<br><br>The app also has: speedometer, HUD and projection display. With them you will know what your speed is. And see the speed limit signs.<br><br>Anti-radar will replace your traditional radar detector, as it displays the location of portable cameras marked by other users of the application in addition to the official stationary cameras. Now you can not only flash your headlights and honk to each other on the roads, but also inform everyone about where the traffic cops are and where the cameras on the roads.<br><br>GPS anti-radar detector will show where the traffic cops are online, cameras on the roads and will help you avoid trouble: speeding, police fines, communication with traffic police.<br><br>What anti radar (radar detector) is better to install for free? Of course, Police Radar - Detector of traffic police cameras.",
